== Overview ==
'''Toilet''' is a medium sized toilet and the second weakest toilet on every map. The toilet is white, and has a [[Small Toilet]] and [[Large Toilet]] variants. It is also slow but has much more health than the Small Toilet. They do 20 damage per hit to your base. 
== Health ==

* Wave 1: 100 HP
* Wave 2: ??? HP

== Strategy ==
*The Toilet is a very easy enemy to defeat, being both low health and slow. Any unit can be used to defeat this enemy except for money troops (exception of [[Scientist Clockman]] and [[Gingerbread House]], which both do damage in both different ways) You can also let this enemy leak into the base as it only does 19 damage.
==Trivia==
*It is the second [[Toilets|enemy]] to appear on every map.
*It is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Normal_Skibidi_Toilet Normal Skibidi Toilet] from the series.
*The Normal Skibidi Toilet first appeared in Episode 1 of the series.
